PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FWomen who were sexually assaulted and
OL,7,Fraped while serving in the British
OL,8,Farmed forces have told ITV News they
OL,9,Fwere failed by the military complaints
OL,10,Fand justice system.
OL,12,FThree former servicewomen were abused
OL,13,Fby their colleagues and then, they
OL,14,Fsay, ignored by senior officers when
OL,15,Fthey reported it.
OL,17,FBut the Ministry of Defence says it is
OL,18,Fcommitted to rooting out offending
OL,19,Ffrom the armed forces and bringing
OL,20,Fabout genuine cultural change.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
