OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FITV News has been given rare access to
OL,7,Fa military investigative crime unit
OL,8,Fand a military court on the Bulford
OL,9,Fmilitary base in Wiltshire, one of two
OL,10,Fmilitary courts in the UK where cases
OL,11,Ffrom around the country are heard.
OL,13,FHere, staff say they are working
OL,14,Ftirelessly to pursue justice for
OL,15,Fvictims.
OL,17,FOne woman, who we are calling Kate,
OL,18,Ftold us she reported sexual harassment
OL,19,Fshe had experienced and witnessed at
OL,20,Fher base to a senior officer.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FAfter taking Kate 'under his wing', he
OL,7,Fthen abused her trust and assaulted
OL,8,Fher.
OL,10,FIf you are affected by any issues
OL,11,Fraised in this article, there is help
OL,12,Favailable on our advice and support
OL,13,Fpage.
OL,15,FAnother woman, who we are calling
OL,16,FAbby, told us she felt bullied and
OL,17,Fpunished in her daily work after word
OL,18,Fhad spread that she had reported being
OL,19,Fsexually assaulted by a colleague.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FAnother, who we're calling Sophia,
OL,7,Fsaid she has 'lost count' of the
OL,8,Fnumber of times she's been groped on
OL,9,Fher chest and between her legs and
OL,10,Fwhen she tried to raise concerns to
OL,11,Fher senior colleagues about the
OL,12,Fassaults, she was belittled and
OL,13,Fignored.
OL,15,FWe have changed the names of each of
OL,16,Fthe women in order to protect their
OL,17,Fidentities.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence says it has
OL,7,Falready kicked around 300 people out
OL,8,Fof the military over the last four
OL,9,Fyears as it tackles unacceptable
OL,10,Fbehaviour.
OL,12,FWatch Her Fight: Are Women in the
OL,13,FArmed Forces Safe? on ITVX
OL,15,FServing personnel have always been
OL,16,Fable to report crime to the civilian
OL,17,Fpolice, but the military operates its
OL,18,Fown internal complaints and justice
OL,19,Fsystem.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FThis is, in part, because the military
OL,7,Fhandles and enforces specific military
OL,8,Flaw that does not apply to civilians.
OL,10,FMilitary courts can, however, try the
OL,11,Fmajority of civilian crimes including
OL,12,Fmurder, manslaughter and sexual
OL,13,Foffences using the same legislation of
OL,14,Fcivilian courts.
OL,16,FHistorically, anyone wanting to report
OL,17,Fa crime within the military would go
OL,18,Fto their chain of command or the
OL,19,Fservice police.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FRecent high profile cases, including
OL,7,Fthat of 19-year-old soldier Jaysley
OL,8,FBeck in 2021, have raised concerns
OL,9,Fabout the military's internal
OL,10,Fcomplaints process and cast doubt on
OL,11,Fwhether it is fit for purpose.
OL,13,FGunner Jaysley Beck, 19, took her own
OL,14,Flife in her barracks at Larkhill Camp,
OL,15,FWiltshire, after her allegations of
OL,16,Fsexual assault against a former
OL,17,Fsergeant were not taken seriously.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FThe teenager reported the assault by
OL,7,FSergeant Major Michael Webber to her
OL,8,Fchain of command the morning after it
OL,9,Fhappened, but it was not then reported
OL,10,Fto the service police.
OL,12,FAt her inquest, the coroner found
OL,13,Fthere were 'systemic failures' in how
OL,14,Fthe Army investigated the incident.
OL,16,FIf you are affected by any issues
OL,17,Fraised in this article, there is help
OL,18,Favailable on our advice and support
OL,19,Fpage.
OL,21,F'An independent process'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FThe Defence Serious Crime Command
OL,7,F(DSCC) was then set up in 2022. Staff
OL,8,Fat the unit investigate allegations of
OL,9,Fserious crime, including sexual
OL,10,Foffences.
OL,12,FThe unit is staffed by members of the
OL,13,Fmilitary as well as civil servants,
OL,14,Fbut any investigation sits outside of
OL,15,Fany direct chain of the command.
OL,17,FIt is hoped that this will encourage
OL,18,Fvictims to feel more confident in
OL,19,Fcoming forward, without fear of any
OL,20,Fconsequence or repercussions.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"When we talk about independence,
OL,7,Fwe're talking about independence from
OL,8,Fdecisions made within the single
OL,9,Fservice chains of command, whether
OL,10,Fthat's the Royal Navy, the Army or the
OL,11,FRoyal Air Force", said Brigadier Kris
OL,12,FRotchell, the head of the DSCC.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"But we are also employees of Defence
OL,7,Fand the unique context that Defence
OL,8,Foperates in means it's really valuable
OL,9,Fthat service police officers are able
OL,10,Fto understand the situations that
OL,11,Fvictims find themselves in, which
OL,12,Fwould be very hard to do without
OL,13,Fperhaps some of that background
OL,14,Fexperience that our service police
OL,15,Fofficers have."
OL,17,F"Victims can come to us with
OL,18,Fconfidence that we'll treat them
OL,19,Ffairly, we'll treat them respectfully,
OL,20,Fwe'll do everything that we can to
OL,21,Fsecure justice for them."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FIf you've been affected by the issues
OL,7,Fraised in this article and would be
OL,8,Fhappy to talk to a journalist, please
OL,9,Femail militarystories@itv.com.
OL,11,FHe added that service personnel could
OL,12,Fbe supported by the unit whether they
OL,13,Fwanted to go through the civilian
OL,14,Fjustice system or the military justice
OL,15,Fsystem.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"I think it's also really important to
OL,7,Funderstand that sometimes the service
OL,8,Fjustice system is the best place for
OL,9,Fcertain allegations and offences to be
OL,10,Fconsidered. But it's really important
OL,11,Fat every step of the way that we
OL,12,Flisten to what victims have got to say.
OL,14,F"We're also seeking new measures
OL,15,Fthrough the Armed Forces Bill, which
OL,16,Fwill strengthen the legislative
OL,17,Fsupport that we can give to people to
OL,18,Fensure that they're protected and that
OL,19,Fjustice is delivered as swiftly as
OL,20,Fpossible", he added.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FIn 2023, the Victim Witness Care Unit
OL,7,Fwas set up, as a place which offers
OL,8,Fspecialist support for service
OL,9,Fpersonnel during the investigative and
OL,10,Fjustice process.
OL,12,FChief Petty Officer Wissam Orfali, an
OL,13,Finvestigator within the unit, said:
OL,14,F"From our initial engagement to the
OL,15,Fprogression of the case to court
OL,16,Fmartial we can dedicate the time to
OL,17,Fdeveloping that relationship with that
OL,18,Findividual.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"Often (victims) express concerns
OL,7,Fabout how they might be seen by their
OL,8,Fpeople who they work with, about how
OL,9,Fthat might reflect on their career.
OL,11,F"One of the things that we do to try
OL,12,Fand break those barriers down is that
OL,13,Fwe all wear civilian clothing. We are
OL,14,Fall military police but the armed
OL,15,Fforces is a very hierarchical
OL,16,Forganisation, and hierarchy, when
OL,17,Fyou're trying to help somebody and
OL,18,Fsupport them and safeguard them be a
OL,19,Fbarrier."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G15/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40216
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F'It is the military's responsibility
OL,7,Fto hold people to account and set the
OL,8,Fstandards'
OL,10,FThe unit supported one soldier, who we
OL,11,Fare calling Gemma. It is not her real
OL,12,Fname as we are protecting her identity.
OL,14,FGemma was sexually assaulted by a
OL,15,Fserving officer at a party. Her case
OL,16,Fwas investigated by the defence
OL,17,Fserious crime command and then
OL,18,Feventually heard at court martial.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G16/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40217
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"At first I felt extremely angry
OL,7,Finitially and a lot of my anger was
OL,8,Fdriven towards the Army and
OL,9,Ffacilitating an environment to allow
OL,10,Fsomebody to behave in that manner.
OL,12,F"I now understand that it's the
OL,13,Findividual's actions and the
OL,14,Findividual that should be held to
OL,15,Faccount rather than an organisation."
OL,17,FGemma's attacker was discharged from
OL,18,Fservice and jailed, but she continued
OL,19,Fto serve.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G17/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40218
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FWhen asked what she would say to any
OL,7,Fvictim of a sexual offence within the
OL,8,Fmilitary who is too afraid to come
OL,9,Fforward, she said: "Things will only
OL,10,Fchange within the military if people
OL,11,Freport individuals.
OL,13,F"But I also believe that it's not
OL,14,Fvictims responsibilities to report to
OL,15,Fprotect other victims. It is the
OL,16,Fmilitary's and any organisation's
OL,17,Fresponsibility to hold people to
OL,18,Faccount and set the standards."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G18/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40219
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FWhile Gemma's experience was positive,
OL,7,Fthere is still widespread concern that
OL,8,Fmany victims are not being protected.
OL,10,F'Women are still being failed'
OL,12,FEmma Norton is the founder of the
OL,13,FCentre for Military Justice and has
OL,14,Frepresented hundreds of women who were
OL,15,Fsexually assaulted or abused during
OL,16,Ftheir careers.
OL,18,FShe says the internal military systems
OL,19,Fare not fit for purpose and lack
OL,20,Findependence.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G19/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40220
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"They are not staffed with people with
OL,7,Fthe requisite skill or training to
OL,8,Fdeal with people who have experienced
OL,9,Fsexual violence or sexual harassment.
OL,11,F"We've had cases where somebody from
OL,12,Fthe chain of command has emailed the
OL,13,Fmilitary police investigators to offer
OL,14,Fa view on the matter that they have
OL,15,Fjust opened.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G20/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40221
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"Another example, a woman who
OL,7,Fcomplained about her chain of command.
OL,8,FThat person in the chain of command
OL,9,Fthen sought advice from somebody in
OL,10,Fthe Defence Serious Crime Unit on how
OL,11,Fto respond to that complaint. These
OL,12,Fare completely unacceptable examples
OL,13,Fof a lack of independence."
OL,15,FEmma said the service complaints and
OL,16,Finvestigations process should be taken
OL,17,Faway from the single services.
OL,19,F"If all of these systems were working
OL,20,Fas they should be, we wouldn't be
OL,21,Fgetting any enquiries", she said.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G21/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
