OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40222
SC,0022
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"But we are getting inquiries from
OL,7,Fwomen who are being sexually harassed
OL,8,Fin their unit, who are being
OL,9,Fvictimised when they report those
OL,10,Fmatters, who, when they report to the
OL,11,FDefence Serious Crime Unit, are very
OL,12,Funhappy with the attitudes they're
OL,13,Fseeing."
OL,15,FThe military court: A fair system for
OL,16,Fvictims?
OL,18,FThe military also has its own service
OL,19,Fjustice system, which the MOD says
OL,20,Fprovides fair and rigorous justice for
OL,21,Fservice personnel.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G22/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40223
SC,0023
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FIt operates in a very similar way to a
OL,7,Fcivilian criminal court, but the key
OL,8,Fdifference is a case is heard by a
OL,9,Fpanel of serving members of the
OL,10,Fmilitary rather than a jury which is
OL,11,Fmade up of randomly selected members
OL,12,Fof the public.
OL,14,FAccording to latest Ministry of
OL,15,FDefence figures, there were 406
OL,16,Finvestigations into reports of sexual
OL,17,Foffences in 2025. The same year, 57
OL,18,Fpeople were found guilty at a military
OL,19,Fcourt.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G23/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40224
SC,0024
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FIn 2025, the same year, there were 85
OL,7,Frape allegations investigated. That
OL,8,Fyear, just six were found guilty.
OL,10,FCleaven Faulkner, the Director of the
OL,11,FMilitary Court Service, said the
OL,12,Fmilitary court shares the same
OL,13,Fchallenges as a civilian crown court.
OL,15,F"It is a judicial process, he said.
OL,16,F"What we must ensure is that judicial
OL,17,Fintegrity. Once it goes to trial,
OL,18,Fyou're in the hands of the board, the
OL,19,Fjury. They will make a decision based
OL,20,Fon the evidence that's presented in
OL,21,Fcourt."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G24/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40225
SC,0025
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FWhen asked whether or not it is fair
OL,7,Fthat the case is heard by serving
OL,8,Fmembers of the military, he said:
OL,9,F"Yes, I think it is. I think it's fair
OL,10,Fon the basis that I know what goes in
OL,11,Fto bringing a board to the court.
OL,13,F"We have a detailed deconfliction
OL,14,Fprocess to ensure that no member of
OL,15,Fthe board is in any way connected to
OL,16,Fany party to the proceedings. That's
OL,17,Fvitally important, and that they have
OL,18,Fno knowledge about this case.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G25/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40226
SC,0026
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"Our judiciary are also independent,
OL,7,Fand, to dispel another myth, they're
OL,8,Fnot actually employed by the MOD,
OL,9,Fthey're actually employees of the
OL,10,FMinistry of Justice, and they're
OL,11,Fappointed to serve in the court
OL,12,Fmartial.
OL,14,F"I am also independent, appointed
OL,15,Fthrough the defence council and I'm
OL,16,Findependent of the service prosecution
OL,17,Fauthority, from the chains of command,
OL,18,Ffrom the judiciary and from political
OL,19,For administrative interference", he
OL,20,Fadded.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G26/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40227
SC,0027
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,FSam des Forges, the Director of
OL,7,FConduct, Equity and Justice at the
OL,8,FMinistry of Defence (MOD), said the
OL,9,Fsexual abuse suffered by women in the
OL,10,Fmilitary uncovered by ITV News is
OL,11,F'brutal and shocking'.
OL,13,FShe said the military court is seeing
OL,14,Fcases heard at a faster pace than in
OL,15,Fthe civilian criminal court, because
OL,16,Fthere is "no backlog".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G27/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40228
SC,0028
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"I think a testament to the support we
OL,7,Fprovide is we have virtually no folk
OL,8,Fwho are withdrawing from cases once
OL,9,Fthey reach court or even during the
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,F"It's a low level compared to the
OL,13,Fcivilian justice system, because we're
OL,14,Fputting that support around folk and
OL,15,Fultimately we want the people who have
OL,16,Fexperienced that to get their
OL,17,Fopportunity in court to receive
OL,18,Fjustice, but also to receive an
OL,19,Felement of closure.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G28/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40229
SC,0029
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"Defence is taking action regardless
OL,7,Fof your rank", she said.
OL,9,FShe added that organisation is working
OL,10,Fhard to ensure there are appropriate,
OL,11,Findependent routes for anyone wanting
OL,12,Fto report a crime in the military.
OL,14,F"I would really encourage women to
OL,15,Freach out when they have been subject
OL,16,Fto those sorts of criminal behaviours,
OL,17,Fto reach out to the police.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G29/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40230
SC,0030
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787082490
OL,3,CIs the UK military's justice system
OL,4,Cprotecting women?
OL,6,F"Now that could be the civilian
OL,7,Fpolice, that could be the service
OL,8,Fpolice, equally the Victim and Witness
OL,9,FCare Unit...We're putting half a
OL,10,Fmillion pounds in to expand that."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G30/30
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
